<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολῠδεύκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Pollux,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.237
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.300
			</span></i>: hence Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολυδεύκειος</span></b> , 
				Ep.
			 fem. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολυδευκεΐη, χείρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυδευκής, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυηχής</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.521
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.38
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ποικίλως μεμιμημένην</span>) and <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοῖς ἐοικυῖαν,</span> cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευκές</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποικίλος, μορφή</span>
			 prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δερκής</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				209
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦκος</span>) <i>very sweet,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλίχρυσος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				625
			</span></i> (cf. Sch. ad loc.).</div>
